        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The <strong>determinant</strong> of a general <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\times 2]</span> matrix\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: [a|b; c|d]]</span>\nis denoted <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\text {det} ({A})]</span> and computed as\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: a|b; c|d]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "The determinant of a general [MATH: 2 \\times 2] matrix\n[MATH: [a|b; c|d]]\nis denoted [MATH: \\text {det} ({A})] and computed as\n[MATH: a|b; c|d]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For example, given the matrix\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: [2|1; 5|3]]</span> \nthe determinant is\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\det(A) = {\\color{blue}{2}} \\cdot {\\color{blue}{3}} - {\\color{red}{1}} \\cdot {\\color{red}{5}} = 1.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "For example, given the matrix\n[MATH: [2|1; 5|3]]\nthe determinant is\n[MATH: \\det(A) = {\\color{blue}{2}} \\cdot {\\color{blue}{3}} - {\\color{red}{1}} \\cdot {\\color{red}{5}} = 1.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To remember how to compute the determinant of a <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\times 2]</span> matrix, you can imagine taking the product of the diagonal of the matrix, and then subtracting the product of the off-diagonal terms, as follows:</p>",
            "readable_text": "To remember how to compute the determinant of a [MATH: 2 \\times 2] matrix, you can imagine taking the product of the diagonal of the matrix, and then subtracting the product of the off-diagonal terms, as follows:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "graphic",
            "normalized_html": "<p><img src=\"/graphics/fa64b649b848e4196e7a4763e7a9e1f6\"></p>",
            "readable_text": "[IMG: /graphics/fa64b649b848e4196e7a4763e7a9e1f6]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/fa64b649b848e4196e7a4763e7a9e1f6",
                "alt": ""
              }
            ],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Later, we will see that the determinant is related to the &quot;volume&quot; spanned by the row vectors or column vectors in a matrix. We will also see that the determinant can tell us about many other properties of a matrix. </p>",
            "readable_text": "Later, we will see that the determinant is related to the \"volume\" spanned by the row vectors or column vectors in a matrix. We will also see that the determinant can tell us about many other properties of a matrix.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>However, in this lesson, we will just focus on computing the determinant.</p>",
            "readable_text": "However, in this lesson, we will just focus on computing the determinant.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [
          {
