        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\det(A),]</span> if <span class=\"math\">[MATH: [3|2; 5|6]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: \\det(A),] if [MATH: [3|2; 5|6]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For a <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\times 2]</span> matrix, the determinant is given by the formula</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: |a|b; c|d|]</span></p><p>Using the formula, we have:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: det(A)|=|3|2; 5|6|; = 3 \u22c5 6 \u2212 2 \u22c5 5; = 18 \u2212 10; = 8]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "For a [MATH: 2 \\times 2] matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n[MATH: |a|b; c|d|]\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n[MATH: det(A)|=|3|2; 5|6|; = 3 \u22c5 6 \u2212 2 \u22c5 5; = 18 \u2212 10; = 8]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \\det(A),] if [MATH: [3|2; 5|6]]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFor a [MATH: 2 \\times 2] matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n[MATH: |a|b; c|d|]\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n[MATH: det(A)|=|3|2; 5|6|; = 3 \u22c5 6 \u2212 2 \u22c5 5; = 18 \u2212 10; = 8]"
      },
