        "has_content_in_snapshot": true,
        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: {A} =\n\\left\\lbrack\n\\matrix {\n2 &amp; -1 \\\n-3 &amp; k\n}\n\\right\\rbrack]</span>\nand\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\det({A}) = 5]</span>, what is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: k?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "If\n[MATH: {A} =\n\\left\\lbrack\n\\matrix {\n2 & -1 \\\n-3 & k\n}\n\\right\\rbrack]\nand\n[MATH: \\det({A}) = 5], what is the value of [MATH: k?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For a <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\times 2]</span> matrix, the determinant is given by the formula</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: |a|b; c|d|]</span></p><p>Using the formula, we have:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: det(A)|=|2|\u2212 1; \u2212 3|k|; = 2 \u22c5 k \u2212 (\u2212 1) \u22c5 (\u2212 3); = 2k \u2212 3]</span></p><p>Since <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\det(A)=5,]</span> we obtain:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: det(A)|= 5; 2k \u2212 3|= 5; 2k|= 8; k|= 4]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "For a [MATH: 2 \\times 2] matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n[MATH: |a|b; c|d|]\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n[MATH: det(A)|=|2|\u2212 1; \u2212 3|k|; = 2 \u22c5 k \u2212 (\u2212 1) \u22c5 (\u2212 3); = 2k \u2212 3]\n\nSince [MATH: \\det(A)=5,] we obtain:\n\n[MATH: det(A)|= 5; 2k \u2212 3|= 5; 2k|= 8; k|= 4]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nIf\n[MATH: {A} =\n\\left\\lbrack\n\\matrix {\n2 & -1 \\\n-3 & k\n}\n\\right\\rbrack]\nand\n[MATH: \\det({A}) = 5], what is the value of [MATH: k?]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFor a [MATH: 2 \\times 2] matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n[MATH: |a|b; c|d|]\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n[MATH: det(A)|=|2|\u2212 1; \u2212 3|k|; = 2 \u22c5 k \u2212 (\u2212 1) \u22c5 (\u2212 3); = 2k \u2212 3]\n\nSince [MATH: \\det(A)=5,] we obtain:\n\n[MATH: det(A)|= 5; 2k \u2212 3|= 5; 2k|= 8; k|= 4]"
